  31:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****           If software trigger is selected, using HAL_DACEx_DualStart() will start
  32:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****           the conversion of the value previously set by HAL_DACEx_DualSetValue().
  33:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****       (+) Use HAL_DACEx_DualStop() to disable both channel and stop conversion
  34:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****           for dual mode operation.
  35:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****       (+) Use HAL_DACEx_DualStart_DMA() to enable both channel and start conversion
  36:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****           for dual mode operation using DMA to feed DAC converters.
  37:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****           First issued trigger will start the conversion of the value previously
  38:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****           set by HAL_DACEx_DualSetValue().
  39:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****           The same callbacks that are used in single mode are called in dual mode to notify
  40:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****           transfer completion (half complete or complete), errors or underrun.
  41:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****       (+) Use HAL_DACEx_DualStop_DMA() to disable both channel and stop conversion
  42:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****           for dual mode operation using DMA to feed DAC converters.
  43:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****       (+) When Dual mode is enabled (i.e. DAC Channel1 and Channel2 are used simultaneously) :
  44:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****           Use HAL_DACEx_DualGetValue() to get digital data to be converted and use
  45:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****           HAL_DACEx_DualSetValue() to set digital value to converted simultaneously in
  46:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****           Channel 1 and Channel 2.
  47:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****      *** Signal generation operation ***
